01:02:04,030 --> 01:02:08,230
You ask yourself, what
do I have to aim at?

969
01:02:08,310 --> 01:02:11,142
So the pathway forward beckons, right?

970
01:02:11,298 --> 01:02:13,950
This is a negotiation, a
dialectical negotiation.

971
01:02:15,234 --> 01:02:19,110
Remember in the Pinocchio movie, when
Pinocchio's conscience first shows up, right?

972
01:02:19,330 --> 01:02:22,350
Jiminy Cricket, JC, Jesus Christ, right?

973
01:02:22,430 --> 01:02:26,570
Jiminy Cricket was southern US
slang for Jesus Christ, JC.

974
01:02:26,670 --> 01:02:29,190
Why would JC be a bug?

975
01:02:29,270 --> 01:02:31,330
Because some things bug you.

976
01:02:31,410 --> 01:02:32,930
They get under your skin, right?

977
01:02:33,010 --> 01:02:40,010
They irritate in a direction and you can
ignore that and you can suppress it,

978
01:02:40,162 --> 01:02:43,622
which is what Jonah did before he
ended up in the belly of the whale.

979
01:02:43,746 --> 01:02:50,560
Like Geppetto, by the way, you can suppress
that or you can engage in a dialectic.

980
01:02:50,640 --> 01:02:56,690
In the Pinocchio movie, Pinocchio engages
in a dialectic with Jiminy Cricket.

981
01:02:56,770 --> 01:02:59,590
He starts out the cricket as a tramp.

982
01:02:59,874 --> 01:03:00,914
With no home.

983
01:03:00,994 --> 01:03:04,914
And the first advice he gives
is cliched and sloganeering.

984
01:03:04,994 --> 01:03:11,060
Slogan from the Welsh, sluag
gherm, battle cry of the dead.

985
01:03:13,506 --> 01:03:18,918
When Jiminy Cricket
shows up, he's generic.

986
01:03:19,362 --> 01:03:21,380
He's like an overbearing superego.

987
01:03:21,460 --> 01:03:28,460
He's not attuned to the specific realities
of the time and place that the puppet

988
01:03:28,706 --> 01:03:31,120
who wishes to be free inhabits.

989
01:03:31,380 --> 01:03:38,246
He brings a collection of
tried and true homilies

990
01:03:38,338 --> 01:03:44,600
that are shallow in
consequence of their overuse

991
01:03:44,680 --> 01:03:46,420
to the initial dialogue.

992
01:03:46,500 --> 01:03:52,934
But the puppet persona possessed, pulled

993
01:03:53,858 --> 01:03:59,174
by spring strings that aren't
under his control and not real,

994
01:03:59,298 --> 01:04:03,980
engages in a dialogue with the
conscience and both transform.

995
01:04:04,060 --> 01:04:10,406
At the end of the movie, Pinocchio
realizes himself and the

996
01:04:11,650 --> 01:04:15,760
cricket ends up in a tuxedo
replacing his tramp clothing.

997
01:04:15,840 --> 01:04:21,734
And he wears a star that's 24 karat
gold that reflects the stars.
